<title>UK: POLL-Top traded options analysts, Extel survey.</title>
<headline>POLL-Top traded options analysts, Extel survey.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted ranking of the top 10 traded options teams plus weights in the 1997 Extel Survey was:</p>
<p> Rank   Investment House</p>
<p>   1.   UBS Limited</p>
<p>   2.   HSBC James Capel</p>
<p>   3.   BZW</p>
<p>   4.   NatWest Securities</p>
<p>   5.   Merrill Lynch</p>
<p>   6.   Panmure Gordon</p>
<p>   7.   SBC Warburg</p>
<p>   8.equal Dresdner Kleinwort Benson</p>
<p>	     Societe Generale Securities</p>
<p>  10.   J.P. Morgan</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5113</p>
